The worker's tests are deliberately not a Python package. `apps/api/tests` is
already the top-level `tests` package, and a second one collides: pytest
resolves `tests.unit.<module>` against whichever tree it imported first, and
mypy refuses two modules with the same name. Without __init__.py each file is
named from its own path and the two trees stay independent.

This file only keeps the directory in Git so `make test` has a path to collect.
